# Analects shared glossary (analects-glossary.json) — the entries this pipeline writes.
# Format, as the Daodejing's: "pinyin — meaning (grammatical info)". Classical senses, never modern.
# The first clause (up to the first ';') doubles as the default in-context gloss in the word popup,
# so write it to stand alone. Polyphones name every reading; each occurrence states its own `py`.
# Later batches ADD keys here; an existing entry may be broadened, never shortened.

